{"id":"7fffbf0fc82b6138","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe.md","title":"ZFC Inner3 Relative Constructible Universe","display":"df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe — ZFC Inner3 Relative Constructible Universe","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe"],"display":"df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe — ZFC Inner3 Relative Constructible Universe","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-constructible.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-definable.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner3-relative-constructible-universe — ZFC Inner3 Relative Constructible Universe"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3743f726a3653802\" href=\"?note=3743f726a3653802\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-constructible.md\">../batch16/58-df-constructible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9a63c990f1580982\" href=\"?note=9a63c990f1580982\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-definable.md\">../batch01/58-df-definable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"30f7fa6c101bbb39\" href=\"?note=30f7fa6c101bbb39\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md\">../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,x,X,P,D,\\alpha,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(A,x,X,P,D,\\alpha,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in,\\dot A}\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in,\\dot A}\\in V\\)</span> is the canonical first-order language with binary relation symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot\\in\">\\(\\dot\\in\\)</span> and unary relation symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot A\">\\(\\dot A\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathfrak X}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\">\\(I^{\\mathfrak X}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\)</span> is the sourced <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-ary relation-interpretation projection of a set-coded structure</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9a63c990f1580982\" href=\"?note=9a63c990f1580982\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-definable.md\">../batch01/58-df-definable.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Limit}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Limit}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (ordinal and limit-ordinal predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\in,\\dot A}(X;P)\\in V\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_{\\in,\\dot A}(X;P)\\in V\\)</span> (the relativized definable power set specified below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha[A]\">\\(L_\\alpha[A]\\)</span> (the set level recursively specified below for each set ordinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3RelativeConstructibleUniverse}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3RelativeConstructibleUniverse}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (relative-constructible-membership predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot A\\neq\\dot\\in\">\\(\\dot A\\neq\\dot\\in\\)</span> 为固定关系符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in,\\dot A}=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in,\\dot A\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle,\\langle\\dot A,1\\rangle\\}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in,\\dot A}=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in,\\dot A\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle,\\langle\\dot A,1\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^n\">\\(X^n\\)</span> 为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的函数集合；不把一元元组等同于其唯一分量。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}relative\\text{-}definable\\text{-}power}\\vdash\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{Def}_{\\in,\\dot A}(X;P)\n=\\Bigl\\{D\\in\\mathcal P(X):\\exists\\mathfrak X\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in,\\dot A})\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak X,\\mathcal L_{\\in,\\dot A})\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak X)=X\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{6em}\\land\\dot\\in\\in\\mathcal L_{\\in,\\dot A}.\\mathrm{Rel}_2\n\\land I^{\\mathfrak X}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\n=\\{a\\in X^2:a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{6em}\\land\\dot A\\in\\mathcal L_{\\in,\\dot A}.\\mathrm{Rel}_1\n\\land I^{\\mathfrak X}_{\\mathrm{rel},1}(\\dot A)=\\{a\\in X^1:a(0)\\in P\\cap X\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S(D,\\mathfrak X,\\mathcal L_{\\in,\\dot A})\n\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}relative\\text{-}definable\\text{-}power}\\vdash\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{Def}_{\\in,\\dot A}(X;P)\n=\\Bigl\\{D\\in\\mathcal P(X):\\exists\\mathfrak X\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in,\\dot A})\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak X,\\mathcal L_{\\in,\\dot A})\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak X)=X\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{6em}\\land\\dot\\in\\in\\mathcal L_{\\in,\\dot A}.\\mathrm{Rel}_2\n\\land I^{\\mathfrak X}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\n=\\{a\\in X^2:a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{6em}\\land\\dot A\\in\\mathcal L_{\\in,\\dot A}.\\mathrm{Rel}_1\n\\land I^{\\mathfrak X}_{\\mathrm{rel},1}(\\dot A)=\\{a\\in X^1:a(0)\\in P\\cap X\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S(D,\\mathfrak X,\\mathcal L_{\\in,\\dot A})\n\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}relative\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}zero} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\bigr)\\to L_0[A]=\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}relative\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}zero} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\bigr)\\to L_0[A]=\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}relative\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}successor} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\to L_{\\alpha+1}[A]=\\operatorname{Def}_{\\in,\\dot A}(L_\\alpha[A];A\\cap L_\\alpha[A])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}relative\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}successor} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\to L_{\\alpha+1}[A]=\\operatorname{Def}_{\\in,\\dot A}(L_\\alpha[A];A\\cap L_\\alpha[A])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}relative\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}limit} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Limit}(\\lambda)\n\\to L_\\lambda[A]=\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\lambda}L_\\beta[A]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}relative\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}limit} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Limit}(\\lambda)\n\\to L_\\lambda[A]=\\bigcup_{\\beta\\in\\lambda}L_\\beta[A]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}relative\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}universe} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3RelativeConstructibleUniverse}_S(x,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land x\\in L_\\alpha[A]\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}relative\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}universe} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3RelativeConstructibleUniverse}_S(x,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\forall a\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(a)\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land x\\in L_\\alpha[A]\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\alpha[A]\">\\(L_\\alpha[A]\\)</span> is a set because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> is a set ordinal. The full <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L[A]\">\\(L[A]\\)</span> is represented by its membership predicate rather than incorrectly typed as an element of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Since <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is used as a predicate on the ordinals, the hierarchy begins with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span>; only the bounded predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\cap L_\\alpha[A]\">\\(A\\cap L_\\alpha[A]\\)</span> is supplied at stage <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The augmented language and its membership/<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> interpretations are selected explicitly.  Thus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\in,\\dot A}\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_{\\in,\\dot A}\\)</span> is grounded in the registered definability predicate rather than an undeclared metalinguistic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}(X;P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}(X;P)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-constructible.md","status":"resolved","id":"3743f726a3653802","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-constructible.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-definable.md","status":"resolved","id":"9a63c990f1580982","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-definable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"30f7fa6c101bbb39","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_o